; Store deployment plane: the AppModel registration the apprepository service
; would keep in its StateRepository.  Seeded so a fresh prefix boots with the
; Store and its framework packages already deployed - kernelbase answers the
; identity APIs from here (Exes\<image>, Identity fallback, Packages\<FullName>)
; and appxdeploymentclient reads the same Packages key for installed-location
; and family enumeration (HKCU view, hence the mirrored HKLM lines).  The Store
; live-launch lane pins the same values per run through WINE_PACKAGE_*; this
; makes them durable.  Paths point at the staged AppxPackages tree; a prefix on
; another host re-stages by overriding these values.
