; The WinRT activation-factory proxy/stub pair.  IActivationFactory (and its base
; IInspectable) marshal over the out-of-proc activation leg through the combase.dll
; PSFactoryBuffer {00020424-0000-0000-C000-000000000046}, the same table Windows
; ships (widl-generated NDR stubs, dlls/combase/combase_{activation,inspectable}.idl).
; The server's standard marshaler creates the stub from it, the client's standard
; unmarshaler the proxy; without the seed CoGetPSClsid reports REGDB_E_IIDNOTREG and
; the marshaled factory comes back E_NOINTERFACE (roapi ServerClass).
